# WeAreCars Management System 🚗

Welcome to the **WeAreCars** Booking Management System. This project demonstrates a beginner-friendly C# Windows Forms application targeting .NET Framework 4.7.2. 

If you are just getting started with C# development, UI construction, or ADO.NET database operations, this reference project breaks down all the basic moving parts that go into creating a functional application!

